<title>PERU: Peru's D'Onofrio Q1 net falls.</title>
<headline>Peru's D'Onofrio Q1 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share - N.A.</p>
<p>Net - 2.2 million soles vs 4.3 million soles.</p>
<p>Revs - 49.3 million soles vs 50.0 million soles.</p>
<p>NOTES: D'Onofrio is Peru's largest ice cream and confectionery company.</p>
<p>In April, Switzerland's Nestle SA bought 98.7 percent of the company.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
